# Kernel Invariants

- Read `docs/kernel-contract.md` and `docs/map.md` before making cross-package changes.
- Do not define Drizzle schema outside `packages/database/src/schema`.
- `@repo/auth` may depend on `@repo/database`; `@repo/database` must never depend on auth.
- Prefer adding new HTTP routes to `apps/api` instead of creating new apps unless explicitly requested.
- Keep `tests/e2e` black-box over HTTP; do not import runtime workspace packages there.
- Keep `pnpm test` for fast in-process coverage; do not move DB-backed tests into that lane.
- Keep the API `/health` smoke in the unit lane via `app.request('/health')`.
- When changing DB tables, update schema files, Drizzle migrations, and database tests together.
- When changing kernel boundaries, test-lane semantics, or CI behavior, update:
  - `docs/kernel-contract.md`
  - `docs/decisions.md`
  - `docs/map.md`
  - relevant ADRs
